@startuml
title Subfigure: #15 DAG 三步调度时序

participant test as T
participant executeSkipN as SK
database state.stack as ST

T -> ST : push(thenBlock)
T -> ST : push(skip)
note over ST : length=2（bottom → top）

T -> SK : executeSkipN(skip, n=0)
activate SK
SK -> ST : pop self
deactivate SK

note over ST : length=1 仅剩 thenBlock

T -> SK : executeSkipN(thenBlock)
note right of T
  下一轮循环到 thenBlock 入口
  由相应 handler 处理
end note

@enduml
